<title>ITALY: S&amp;P confirms Fiat short-term A2 rating.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P confirms Fiat short-term A2 rating.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>International rating agency Standard and Poors has confirmed car group Fiat's short-term A2 rating, Catherine Farde Ruffat, a Fiat analyst, told Reuters on Friday.</p>
